8, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 287, "last_played": 1788759176, "avatar": "2be5a483514ac0de147936ff6bb6a67aa7a9bfc3"}, "language": "english", "review": "its fun", "timestamp_created": 1788072370, "timestamp_updated": 1788072370, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234054464", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997801929", "personaname": "Syrsly", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/syrsly/", "num_games_owned": 3616, "num_reviews": 460, "playtime_forever": 151, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 151, "last_played": 1788071400, "avatar": "fa06dba82c265abb2e4bc1d444b11c84681ffafb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played a couple hours with a friend and we had a good time, but... the game's surprise ending happened way too soon, and there was no build-up to it. Now, we're just playing for the unlocks and for the enjoyment of the combat mechanics and movement mechanics. We're already feeling like we hit end game content, which is weird because we have only played for 2 hours. Hopefully the updates add a ton more levels and more narrative because the narrative could be a good comedy.\n\nOverall, good short-term enjoyment. Unsure if it'd be good long-term. Game performs well.", "timestamp_created": 1788072223, "timestamp_updated": 1788072223, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233996727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155989134", "personaname": "✪ Ka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198155989134/", "num_games_owned": 309, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 563, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 195, "last_played": 1788978108, "avatar": "cd2922332ee544735429481ec08698944922e9be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Enjoyable game. But 1 THING that ruins it is that once you run out of time, spawnss DEATH who is Invulnerable to anything. you cant kill it, cant dodge it, which actually for me kills the joy. Instead add more enemies, tougher enemies who with each spawn become stronger, who force you to leave. Not a DEATH who comes for your soul, and you cant do anything. Meanwhile just because of this stupid Death I leave negative review.", "timestamp_created": 1788017151, "timestamp_updated": 1788017151, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.42413291335105896", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1788374171, "developer_response": "thanks for your review and heard on the feedback. We want to make the end of time wraith mechanic feel better, just haven't been able to get to that yet. \nFor now, we strongly advise you get to the boss and exit van before the timer is up!", "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233920832", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101322544", "personaname": "Tommy Pencils", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101322544/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 1469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1028, "last_played": 1789617079, "avatar": "1c47500128fa8bb2d5eb1609fec833ac592150b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "My only issue is the art style, and the voice acting. Its not that its bad, i just dont like it.  i dont like how the archer guy looks, its the moustache and sleeveless shirt. the ears also. either make him a manly bearded huntsman or a nimble and slender wood elf, he has cool abilities but his appearance makes me not want to play him. wizard dude is alright, a little tacky. frog dude is fine, warrior girl is also alright. The alternate skins could use some work imo but they arent bad.\nthe coolest character is the paladin dude. THAT BEING SAID... its still a cool game.\n\nThis game is really fun, very similar to risk of rain 2, i like the open level and rpg aspect. the characters are fun to play and the game offers some versatility per build. the weapons are fun to use and the abilities are super cool with great synergy. \nThe final boss is a little too similar to Mithrix from Risk of Rain 2, even the part where he takes your weapons away. Its a toned down version of mithrix and instead of taking your items, he takes your weapons. still fun and unique in its  combat.\nim gonna play it right now", "timestamp_created": 1787939275, "timestamp_updated": 1789063349, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233906220", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070840095", "personaname": "LeGhosTv", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070840095/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 1907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1588, "last_played": 1787947723, "avatar": "5570bdc9303ae03500324a012bc61fadfbcfabc1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ta buenito", "timestamp_created": 1787927045, "timestamp_updated": 1787927045, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "wei